-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:6">. </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:7" class="r-b88u0q">Purchase label anda </strong><span data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:8">akan berada pada </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:9" class="r-b88u0q">ruangan send_to</strong><span data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:10">. Anda boleh </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:11" class="r-b88u0q">simpan Purchase label</strong><span data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:12"> </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:13" class="r-b88u0q">anda</strong><span data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:14"> untuk di </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:15" class="r-b88u0q">masukkan pada penetapan Commerce anda</strong><span data-offset-key="98950de7cac84e36b28054223dc89772:16">. Ini adalah contoh Purchase label : AW-312341234/AbCfCNvJmfsCEMXL7abC</span></span></div></div></div></div><div><div data-key="bdad61403bd242f5b6efe8913b121d64" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1mlwlqe r-eqz5dr r-1q142lx r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-1l7z4oj r-95jzfe r-1yzf0co r-bnwqim r-417010"><div data-block-content="bdad61403bd242f5b6efe8913b121d64" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1ro0kt6 r-eqz5dr r-16y2uox r-1wbh5a2 r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-bnwqim r-417010"><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-18u37iz r-1777fci"><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div data-slate-void="true" data-key="4681911550da40a4bc6ff3ca4cb22d70"><div><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-z2wwpe r-bnwqim"><div tabindex="0" class="css-1dbjc4n r-1loqt21 r-1otgn73 r-1i6wzkk r-lrvibr" style="-webkit-transition-duration:0s;transition-